OL,3,GNEWSAMove to give colleges'
OL,4,Aindependence after donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals have been submitted to make
OL,7,Ftwo private colleges independent so
OL,8,Fthey can take up the offer of a
OL,9,F"substantial donation".
OL,11,FThe Policy & Resources Committee and
OL,12,Fthe Committee for Education, Sport &
OL,13,FCulture have asked for approval to
OL,14,Fprogress the independence of The
OL,15,FLadies' College and Elizabeth College.
OL,17,FThis comes after a proposed
OL,18,Fphilanthropic gift that would allow the
OL,19,Ftwo schools to give up their annual
OL,20,FStates grants totalling #2.2m and start
OL,21,Fvarious projects.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
