OL,3,GNEWSAMove to give colleges'
OL,4,Aindependence after donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Lindsay de Sausmarez, President
OL,7,Fof Policy & Resources, said: "This
OL,8,Fexceptionally generous gift will give
OL,9,FThe Ladies' College and Elizabeth
OL,10,FCollege long-term financial security
OL,11,Fwithout need of taxpayers' support."
